Z||000005||rogergarrison||12-30-2001||12:38 AM||||a couple of neat tricks on exhaust is to drill the tip a little ways in....go slow and carefully so it dont split. another way is to cut it off and buy the small aluminum tubing at the hobby shop. It bends very ez and looks real for only a dollar or 2 for a foot long piece. Makes great custom headers too, cut bend and superglue.||||reg||1
